---
layout: base.njk
bodyAttrs: onload='renderIndexShow("channel_index")'
eleventyComputed:
  header_scripts: |
    {% if build.env === "production" %}
      <script type="module" src="/vite-index_show.js"></script>
    {% else %}
      <script type="module">import {renderIndexShow} from "http://localhost:5173/src/client/index_show.tsx"</script>
    {% endif %}

    {% if build.env === "production" %}
      <script type="module" src="/vite-main.js"></script>
    {% else %}
      <script type="module" src="http://localhost:5173/src/client/main.js"></script>
    {% endif %}
---

<main>
  <p>ベストなSSGを探しに我々はアマゾンの奥地へと向かった。</p>
</main>
<nav>
  {{ page.url }}
  {{ page.fileSlug }}
  {{ page.date }}
  {{ eleventy .version }}
</nav>
<hr />
<div id="channel_index"></div>
